        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nang himdaimei ram guang pukhou,",
            "Thanmei nun guaile banchra guai #@8na;",
            "Papmei ta ndan ni,",
            "Ai #@8 ringmei tei latou puni cho?",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He pap khou keimei ai e,",
            "Jailou o poubaumei;",
            "Ringmei duikhun khou jailou o,",
            "Apap khiu than lou khang,",
            "Nang ram gaimei tei guangtang ngam diu khang.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkauh namdai ningyou gan khou,",
            "Tang khang rana ninga tingjing ngammak;",
            "Jianmei nun tat puiram,",
            "Poule nangram guangtang ngam kan nithe.",
            "",
            "3. Nang himdaimei ram guangtang pukhou,",
            "Kandih khou ai rianra le aram kap;",
            "Ninga jao dat lak khe,",
            "Nthiam pheiban liang tat bam kanni the.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih ningjung liat laknga kei,",
            "Neilana janggai khatsini ai hou mak;",
            "Poubaumei #@8 hamma,",
            "Achun simei sumgai lou ngam mak ge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
